  "finding": "Aqua Fusion direct Hand/Grave paths and Dinomorphia Provocation now CompleteProcedure only when native Fusion Summon succeeds. Eight original-source cases pass: six success/material-dependent failure paths plus original optional-decline/immune-material regressions. Old source falsely marks each failed summon and then actually revives the never-summoned recipient from GY in three cases. New source blocks those native ordinary revivals and preserves actual proper Fusion/revival. Omitted completion fails three positive revivals; disabled conditional summoning restriction fails three negative original-Fusion outcomes.",
  "qualification": "Full original source operations/current installed metadata, neutral Fusion recipe/material-dependent restriction/probe. Existing explicit test-only IsFaceupEx and empty GetMustMaterial/CheckMustMaterial mappings reused from earlier Fusion fixtures; original mandatory-material/recipient/Omega qualifications remain open. No production API replacement or whole-card/live certification.",
